2026-01-01 setup
  a  1 EUR
  a:b  2 EUR
  a:c:d  3 EUR
  ab  100 EUR
  h:b  2 EUR
  i  1 EUR
  i:b  2.5 EUR
  j:b  2 EUR
  k:b  2 EUR
  k:c  3 USD
  k  4 GBP
  m  2 EUR
  z

2026-01-02 =* counts a and everything under a:, not ab
  a  =* 10 EUR
  z

2026-01-03 then = sees only a itself: asserted minus the sub-accounts
  a  = 5 EUR
  z

2026-01-04 an account with no postings of its own
  h  =* 5 EUR
  z

2026-01-05 zero difference, but the account's own balance becomes 3.5 - 2.5 = 1.0
  i  =* 3.5 EUR
  i  = 2 EUR
  z

2026-01-06 ==* zeroes every other commodity, in the account itself
  k  ==* 10 EUR
  z

2026-01-07 a sub-account changes, then ==* again: only the change is added
  k:b  = 0 EUR
  k  ==* 10 EUR
  z

2026-01-08 on an account without sub-accounts =* is the same as =
  m  =* 5 EUR
  z
